WEBVTT

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:09.510
You always get that, Chizuru.

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.570
Is it really that good?

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.990
100% fruit juice.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:17.240
<b>Mixed Juice</b>

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.240
With all the different fruits in here, 
I feel like I'm getting a good deal!

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:19.170
Let me have a taste.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.890
Don't do that!

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:23.480
Give me some of your apple juice, then!

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:24.550
Hey! Give it here!

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:28.680
But you've got apple juice 
in your mixed fruit juice.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.980
No buts!

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:30.950
Hey, you!

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:31.870
Give it back!

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:34.040
My 100% fruit juice!

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:37.850
How do you guys keep up the 100% 
stupidity all the time?

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:37.220
100%, damn it!

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:39.980
Damn it! You bastard!

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:40.000
It's not that great.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:41.890
100%!

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:47.780
Our unchanging daily routine.

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:50.980
While we enjoy these quiet days,

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:54.530
the slightest change causes great excitement.

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:58.710
Sorry I'm late.

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:00.700
I forgot something.

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:03.150
It's the workplace experience list.

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:04.290
Workplace experience?

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:06.760
Yes.

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:10.000
<b>Regarding Work Experience Placement</b>

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:39.370
Oh, yeah. We were given something like that.

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:41.380
I haven't really looked at it yet, though.

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:43.990
Is that the field trip second 
years take every year?

00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:45.430
Just look at this.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:50.140
Our old kindergarten, Hidamari Kindergarten, 
is on the workplace experience list.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:52.110
You're right.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:55.940
Why don't we all go to Hidamari 
Kindergarten together?

00:02:57.370 --> 00:02:58.470
Good idea.

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:02.480
I wonder if Kaori-sensei's still there.

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:03.900
Don't you?

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:05.570
What?...

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:06.910
Don't ask me!

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:08.790
That happened when we were kids.

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:10.910
I wonder if they have more toys now.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.320
They might.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:14.660
Hey, Chizuru...

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:20.170
Oh, go right ahead.

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:23.880
Don't worry about me. Have 
all the fun you want.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:26.840
Outsiders will quietly 
observe from over here.

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:29.220
Stop your annoying pouting.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:30.990
I'm not pouting.

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:34.410
I'm the only one who attended 
a different kindergarten.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:36.990
I do feel a little out of the loop,

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:39.280
but I wouldn't pout over something like that.

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:42.840
You're pouting while you're saying that.

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:43.990
Chizuru-kun.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:46.740
Chizuru-kun, come with us.

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:49.880
But I didn't go there.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:52.160
That's not important.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.880
I want to go with you.

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:57.910
Shun-chan...

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:01.120
Thank you.

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:02.730
You're the only one, Shun-chan.

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:06.060
You're the only one who 
hears my true thoughts.

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:08.390
We all heard them when 
you said them out loud.

00:04:08.690 --> 00:04:09.940
It's decided, then.

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:12.140
We're all going to Hidamari Kindergarten.

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.140
Yup.

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:15.150
I'm so excited.

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:17.340
Yeah, me too.

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:20.680
I wonder how Kaname's love life will unfold.

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:23.700
I told you, I don't feel that way any more!

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:30.110
Despite all the seasons 
and time that has passed,

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:32.710
we always remembered our childhood.

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:38.000
We were both excited and apprehensive 
to visit the kindergarten.

00:04:42.270 --> 00:04:43.720
This brings back memories.

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:45.930
It hasn't changed one bit.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:50.990
Was the jungle gym always this small?

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:55.890
The kindergarten hasn't changed, 
but we've certainly grown.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:00.860
Those kids don't even let the 
cold stop them from playing.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.520
You're right.

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:05.300
It's the middle of winter, too.

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:06.860
Huh? What'd you say?

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.700
What's with you, Kaname? 
Are you nervous?

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:11.850
You can't blame him.

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:14.160
He's about to meet his 
beloved Kaori-sensei...

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:20.590
Whatever you do, don't say a word about it!

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:23.430
If that little monkey 
finds out about this...

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:25.340
You won't like what I'll do to you.

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:27.250
Okay.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:31.210
So this is your kindergarten.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:33.470
Chizuru-kun, where are you going?

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:35.160
I'm just going to look around.

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:37.330
Ow.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.220
Chizuru-kun, are you all right?

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:41.720
You little... who are you?

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:46.650
Who do you think you are, trespasser?

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:49.680
Hey, that's dangerous!

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.550
Not that I care what happens to this monkey.

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:54.150
We're just here on our 
workplace experience.

00:05:56.630 --> 00:05:58.090
Listen to me!

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:01.170
I don't listen to evildoers.

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:04.050
Trust me, we're not evil.

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:07.260
We're... Ow. My hair's stuck...

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:09.220
Shun-chan!

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:10.830
W-W-Wait!

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:20.860
Thank you.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:23.020
You should be more careful, miss.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:25.110
Don't you know how important 
a woman's hair is?

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:28.320
I'm actually a man.

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:29.150
What?

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:35.570
Either way, it seems I've 
done something terrible.

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:36.870
Huh?

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:38.050
Who cares?

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:39.710
It's already dead.

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:42.210
It's not dead.

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:45.430
It'll grow new leaves in the spring.

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:47.200
It will?

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:50.750
You think you can do whatever you want?

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:50.780
Gotcha, you brat!

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:52.730
We'll turn you in to your teacher!

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:55.510
Let go of me, stupid Monkey 
and stupid Four-eyes!

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:57.960
Hey, guys...

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:58.600
Ow, stop struggling!

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:01.350
Kaname-kun, Shun-kun, Yuta-kun, Yuki-kun!

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:03.610
Hey!

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:05.230
Keep a tight grip on him, Kanamecchi!

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:07.020
You let him get away!

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.990
Thank you for coming.

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:12.610
Kaori-sensei.

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:14.200
It's good to see you again.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.510
Thank you for having us today.

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:18.250
No, thank you.

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:21.300
I-It's...

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.420
good to see you.

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:26.630
Kaname-kun, you've grown so much.

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:29.470
Yes, he's got quite the attitude now.

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:30.670
Hey, hey!

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:33.390
I'm everyone's friend, Chizuru Tachibana!

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:35.690
It's nice to meet you!

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:37.220
Nice to meet you.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:40.320
I can't believe how beautiful you are.

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.160
Do you have a boyfriend...

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.080
What, Kanamecchi?

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:46.620
I was just getting to know her.

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:50.610
You mean you were hitting on her.

00:07:53.010 --> 00:07:54.570
Okay, everyone!

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:59.900
These students from Homare High 
School will be your teachers today!

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:02.150
Play nice, children!

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:03.460
Okay!

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:07.680
I need to go see the director.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.620
Keep an eye on the kids.

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:11.050
Okay.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:13.160
No problem. Easy.

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.870
You have antennae!

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:27.270
He's a rhinoceros beetle!

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:29.600
I'll be your wife!

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:32.460
That's a little fast for me.

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:31.110
No fair!

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:34.580
I want to take things slow.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:37.830
Hey, why are your faces the same?

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.620
Everything about us matches 
because we're friends.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.710
You're so cute!

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:45.450
What? Wait...

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:46.620
Why?

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:48.950
Hey! Give me back my glasses!

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:50.640
They're not a toy!

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:51.380
Run!

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:58.810
Let's go shopping today.

00:08:58.810 --> 00:09:00.810
That sounds wonderful.

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:03.930
I want new clothes.

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:07.310
This dress would look good on you.

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:10.470
Super Lightning Blizzard!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:14.020
Fight back with your own special attack!

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:15.900
O-Oh, right!

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:19.160
Strawberry Milk Cream Special!

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:22.540
It's not supposed to be a dessert.

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:23.580
Right.

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:28.450
Darling, we've been married for two years.

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:31.090
I want a kid.

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:33.310
You want a kid?

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:37.600
I think that would be a crime, age-wise.

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:41.100
Stop playing house as if it's real.

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:45.390
Do I want a boy or a girl?

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:47.550
How about this, Sono-chan?

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:50.300
This is our son.

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:50.980
What?

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:54.200
No, no, no! There's no 
way I'm playing house!

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:57.700
If you don't think you can, 
you'll never be able to.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:58.950
That's fine with me!

00:09:59.940 --> 00:10:03.660
Now that the whole family's 
here, let's have dinner.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:05.570
Eat up.

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:07.740
Om nom nom.

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:11.280
You're the best cook in the world.

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:13.330
Thank you, dear.

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:14.710
You too, Kaname.

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:19.680
You've got to do this. Come on.

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:23.470
You're supposed to be taking this 
workplace experience seriously.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:29.900
Om nom nom.

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:32.110
It's so good.

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:34.020
Nom nom.

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.190
You bastard!

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:36.580
You laughed, didn't you?

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:38.650
Of course I didn't.

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:40.680
Some food got stuck in my throat.

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:42.470
We're not actually eating!

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:45.940
How dare you speak that way to your parents!

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:47.850
I'm so upset!

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:50.530
Stop being so dramatic! We're only playing house!

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:51.670
Honk, honk.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.920
Get out of the way.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.480
The second son's here. Honk, honk.

00:10:56.480 --> 00:11:00.920
We don't need you bringing 
your nonsense into this game!

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:05.140
I refuse to play a character 
that isn't at least this dark!

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:09.020
I don't remember raising 
such a terrible son.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.050
Pow.

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:12.770
Honey, stop!

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:15.480
He's not your son.

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:17.570
Shut up.

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:20.070
Honey, calm down!

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:23.780
Do you want to play, too?

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:29.320
Why would I play house with you?

00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:30.500
Lame!

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:33.270
There you go again, Ken-chan!

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:34.380
Now, now.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:35.780
It's not so bad.

00:11:35.780 --> 00:11:36.960
What do you think you're doing?

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:38.340
Let go!

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:42.520
This guy will be your third son.

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:44.190
Thanks.

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:45.440
Third son?

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:49.310
Three might be... too many.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.670
Huh? Why?

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:55.440
We don't have enough tableware.

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:58.220
Having a third might be problematic.

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:02.940
Then, I'll be the first son.

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:05.200
That's the spirit.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:08.780
But the guy with the glasses is our first son.

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:11.710
I'm much better suited for the job than him.

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:14.580
You can be the dog, Four-eyes!

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:15.770
Dog?

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:17.330
Go be a good guard dog!

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:20.340
You brat, I'll show you...

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:21.420
Stop!

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:23.590
Don't say such terrible things to my child!

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:29.520
Stop being so over dramatic!

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:32.120
What are you doing?

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:33.810
Ken-chan, you're awful.

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:35.320
This is stupid!

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:38.340
Playing house is so boring!

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:43.540
It's Kaname's fault for not 
being a guard dog.

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:44.370
Hey!

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:45.860
You're blaming me?

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:00.590
Bathroom, bathroom...

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:05.000
Shun-chan...

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.890
What's wrong?

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.920
I'm exhausted.

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:10.810
I can't do this any more.

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:14.990
I can't keep up with kids these days.

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:18.560
I know. Maybe they're the new generation.

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:22.370
You've all gotten old fast.

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:27.660
We were naughty and precocious 
when we were little, too.

00:13:28.050 --> 00:13:30.170
Yeah.

00:13:30.170 --> 00:13:31.890
I guess so.

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:34.850
What? Was Kanamecchi in love with someone?

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:37.330
You were?

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:42.800
Oh, but kids these days are 
much naughtier... right?

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:45.630
Yeah, they are!

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:48.220
Especially that brat Ken-chan.

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:49.840
Ken-chan?

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:51.450
Between when we first got 
here and playing house...

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:53.920
I've had enough of his rudeness!

00:13:57.260 --> 00:14:01.050
He didn't seem like such a bad kid to me.

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:04.990
I'm sure he's a good kid really.

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:08.390
He just doesn't know how to show it.

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:09.630
Okay, okay.

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:11.950
You see the good in everyone.

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:14.820
Are you making fun of me?

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:16.820
There you all are.

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:17.960
Kaori-sensei.

00:14:18.320 --> 00:14:22.000
It's about to be snack time.
Would you like to join us?

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:26.760
Kaori-sensei, I'm amazed you didn't think 
twice about coming into the men's room.

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:29.380
What if we were in the middle of something?

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:30.470
Huh?

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:35.430
Which means she doesn't see us as men. 
Not now and not back then.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:36.850
Shut up.

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.900
You're not going to eat?

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:49.130
Huh? It's got nothing to 
do with you, Four-eyes.

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:50.260
You brat!

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:53.340
You're always trying to start fights.

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:56.370
I don't like you.

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:59.370
I hope Kaori-sensei turns you down soon!

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:01.740
Th-That's not...

00:15:01.740 --> 00:15:02.960
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:15:03.510 --> 00:15:09.220
Sono-chan didn't grab you 
because she l-loves you.

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:11.360
You were just playing house.

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:13.190
Don't let it go to your head, octopus!

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:18.930
<i>Okay, right. I see.</i>

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:28.770
H-Hey.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:31.330
Ken-chan?

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:32.560
You can have this.

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:35.180
What is that?

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:37.070
C- Cookies.

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:37.950
Whose?

00:15:38.760 --> 00:15:40.480
Wh-Who cares whose they are?

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:41.750
Just eat them!

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:44.380
Ken-chan, I bet you stole them.

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:45.140
I didn't...

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:45.930
Sensei!

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:48.230
Ken-chan's stealing other's cookies!

00:15:48.230 --> 00:15:51.720
Again? Bad boy.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:16:02.810
Bad boy, bad boy, bad boy...

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:05.350
Ken-chan, you're so mean.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:08.030
Sensei, Ken-chan ate our cookies.

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:10.870
Hey, hold on...

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:14.660
Kaname-kun, are you all right?

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:18.670
You little twerp, you won't get away with this!

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:19.790
Kaname-kun!

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:24.020
Damn it, where'd he...

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:28.960
What is this?

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:34.670
It'll grow new leaves in the spring.

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:36.260
It will?

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:47.810
Hey!

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:49.660
Don't follow me!

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:53.610
I don't wanna hear what you have to say!

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:55.110
Hey.

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:57.030
Go away.

00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:13.660
You put way too much in your mouth, stupid.

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:17.750
<i>I'm sure he's a good kid really.</i>

00:17:18.670 --> 00:17:21.640
<i>He just doesn't know how to show it.</i>

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:32.740
That's disgusting!

00:17:32.740 --> 00:17:36.410
You're getting it all over my shoes!

00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:40.280
Sheesh.

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:41.490
Let's go.

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:43.790
Where are we going?

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:47.210
Huh? You should know 
better than anyone else.

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:49.220
It's fine! It's fine!

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:50.640
It's not fine!

00:17:50.640 --> 00:17:53.630
You've gotta do the right thing...

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:54.940
It doesn't matter!

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:56.320
I'm a bully!

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:58.180
She already hates me.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:17:59.500
There's nothing...

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:05.510
Let's go.

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:15.240
Sono-chan, you're in the middle.

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:16.060
Okay.

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:25.000
Kagome kagome, the bird in the cage...

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:24.180
Sorry.

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:29.460
When will you come out?

00:18:26.550 --> 00:18:27.510
What?

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:37.420
In the evening of the dawn, 
the crane and turtle slipped.

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:42.000
Who's standing right behind you?

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:55.320
Ken-chan?

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:00.130
It really is you!

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:01.870
H-H-How'd you know?

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:05.670
Because I smelled something sweet.

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:12.710
Sometimes I smell sweets 
when you're near me.

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:14.290
It's so weird.

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:17.720
I don't know why, since you're so mean.

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:23.520
Sorry.

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:31.650
Sorry about the cookies... and your house game.

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:36.080
I'm sorry.

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:48.790
Kaori-sensei, thank you for 
letting us come today.

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:52.920
No, thank you. I had so much fun.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:54.790
You're welcome to come back any time.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:56.160
Okay.

00:19:57.690 --> 00:19:59.990
Oh? What is it, Ken-chan?

00:20:01.610 --> 00:20:02.720
Oh, right.

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:04.580
You're here to say goodbye.

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:10.260
I'm so sorry, Kaname-kun!

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:11.830
Are you okay?

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:13.440
Uh, fine.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.420
Ken-chan!

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:18.650
See ya, Four-eyes!

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:24.050
Don't give me that, you little twerp!

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:28.390
Those boys were fun, weren't they?

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:30.920
They're just loud.

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:33.770
I wish we could play house with them again.

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:38.170
I'd be that cool guy's wife again.

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:40.080
Ken-chan.

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:43.900
What do you want the guy 
with the glasses to be?

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:44.680
Huh?

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:49.660
My brother.

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:57.190
I had so much fun at Hidamari Kindergarten.

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:01.790
You all went there, huh? Lucky.

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:05.450
There weren't any kids that precocious 
while we were there, though.

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:08.420
There were. Two of which I knew.

00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:10.600
Let's go again sometime.

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:11.690
You guys go.

00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:15.210
I won't go anywhere I might 
see that brat again.

00:21:15.740 --> 00:21:18.630
You're still mad about that?

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:23.250
You two looked like you could be brothers.

00:21:23.480 --> 00:21:24.520
What?

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:27.470
Cut it out. We're not anything alike.

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:29.970
That's not true.

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:32.650
He was just as passionate about the girl he liked...

00:21:32.650 --> 00:21:36.810
as you were about Kaori-sensei.

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:47.940
Really? Kanamecchi, were you really?

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:51.040
Shun, I told you not to tell him.

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:50.990
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:51.540
Huh?

00:21:52.030 --> 00:21:52.790
Oh!

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:56.820
That didn't count. I didn't mean to.

00:21:57.370 --> 00:22:00.980
I can't believe you spilled the beans.

00:22:03.310 --> 00:22:06.300
Chizuru, you shouldn't laugh so much.

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:08.260
It was just youthful indiscretion.

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:12.570
Don't treat someone's first love like a mistake!

00:22:15.530 --> 00:22:19.740
It was as though we were standing 
in a beam of sunlight.

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:26.240
It changed cold winters and hot 
summers into a comfortable warmth.

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:32.950
I wonder how far and how long we'll 
travel together from that place.

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:39.880
The Sunshine Song
